      "approachable weekly AI briefing feeling",
      "playful but organized presentation",
      "two-character conversational hosting",
      "central evidence-first storytelling",
      "clean chapter-to-chapter rhythm",
      "light broadcast-like structure without copying broadcast branding"
    ],
    "copy_boundary": "Match the overall mood, pacing, friendliness, information hierarchy and hosting feel; do not reproduce identifiable background art, exact palette, decorative motifs, logos, title bars, borders or brand identity."
